<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Detailed Derivation of Computational Complexity</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix provides a detailed derivation of Equations (<a href="#S4.E1" title="In 4.1 Cache Miss ‣ 4 Attention Complexity Analysis ‣ From TLinFormer to TConstFormer: The Leap to Constant-Time Transformer Attention Achieving 𝒪(1) Computation and 𝒪(1) KV Cache during Autoregressive Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E5" title="In 4.2 Cache Hit ‣ 4 Attention Complexity Analysis ‣ From TLinFormer to TConstFormer: The Leap to Constant-Time Transformer Attention Achieving 𝒪(1) Computation and 𝒪(1) KV Cache during Autoregressive Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>) from the main text. We analyze the upper bound of the computational cost by considering a full computation cycle where both the context and generation windows are updated. The analysis is divided into costs associated with the left (context) and right (generation) windows.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Cache Miss</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Computational Cost of the Left Window (Historical Context)</span>:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">First Layer Cross-Attention</span>: The query sequence from the context window attends to the full history. Cost is <math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D\cdot(N-W_{\mathit{og}})\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D\cdot(N-W_{\mathit{og}})\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Intermediate Self-Attention Layers (<math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math> layers)</span>: Self-attention is performed within the context window of size <math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{\mathit{oh}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{\mathit{oh}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Cost is <math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Final Layer Cross-Attention (Dimension Restoration)</span>: The full history attends to the processed context window to restore the original sequence length. Cost is <math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D\cdot(N-W_{\mathit{og}})\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D\cdot(N-W_{\mathit{og}})\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Total Cost of the Left Window (<math id="A1.I1.i1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{left}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic">left</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{left}}</annotation></semantics></math>):</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{left}}=2D(N-W_{\mathit{og}})W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{left}}=2D(N-W_{\mathit{og}})W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Computational Cost of the Right Window (Generation Area)</span>:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cross-Attention with Intermediate Context Layers (<math id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H+1</annotation></semantics></math> layers, including final output layer)</span>: The generation window attends to the processed context window. Cost is <math id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(H+1)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(H+1)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Causal Self-Attention (All <math id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H+2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H+2</annotation></semantics></math> layers, including final output layer)</span>: Causal self-attention is performed within the generation window. Cost is <math id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(H+2)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(H+2)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Total Cost of the Right Window (<math id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{right}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic">right</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{right}}</annotation></semantics></math>):</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{right}}=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{right}}=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Derivation of Total Computational Cost (<math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>):</span>
The total cost is the sum of the costs of the two windows, <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=C_{\text{left}}+C_{\text{right}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=C_{\text{left}}+C_{\text{right}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left[2D(N-W_{\mathit{og}})W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left[2D(N-W_{\mathit{og}})W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left[(H+1)DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left[(H+1)DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">Step 1: Expand all terms</td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-2DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-2DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\left(HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\left(HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">Step 2: Combine like terms</td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-2DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-2DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=2DNW_{\mathit{oh}}-DW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HDW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">Step 3: Factor out common factor <math id="A1.EGx2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>D</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math> and reorganize by variables <math id="A1.EGx2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.EGx2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=D\left[2NW_{\mathit{oh}}-W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=D\left[2NW_{\mathit{oh}}-W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HW_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+HW_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}+HW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+2W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody><tr class="ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_left" style="white-space:normal;" colspan="5">Step 4: Final organized form (grouping terms related to <math id="A1.EGx2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.EGx2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>H</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H</annotation></semantics></math>)</td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=D\left[N(2W_{\mathit{oh}})+H(W_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}})+2W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}-W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=D\left[N(2W_{\mathit{oh}})+H(W_{\mathit{oh}}^{2}+W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}+W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}})+2W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}-W_{\mathit{og}}W_{\mathit{oh}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Derivation complete.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Cache Hit</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Computational Cost of the Left Window (Historical Context)</span>:</p>
<ul id="A1.I2.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1.I1.1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"></span>
<div id="A1.I2.i1.I1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{left}}=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{left}}=0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Computational Cost of the Right Window (Generation Area)</span>:</p>
<ul id="A1.I2.i2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cross-Attention with Intermediate Context Layers (<math id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H+1</annotation></semantics></math> layers, including final output layer)</span>: Only the last token of the generation window participates in the computation. Cost is <math id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(H+1)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(H+1)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{oh}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Causal Self-Attention (All <math id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H+2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H+2</annotation></semantics></math> layers, including final output layer)</span>: Causal self-attention is performed within the generation window. The upper bound on cost is <math id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(H+2)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(H+2)\cdot D\cdot W_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_italic">Total Cost of the Right Window (<math id="A1.I2.i2.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{right}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">C</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic">right</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{right}}</annotation></semantics></math>):</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{right}}=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{right}}=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Derivation of Total Computational Cost (<math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>):</span>
The total cost is the sum of the costs of the two windows, <math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=C_{\text{left}}+C_{\text{right}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=C_{\text{left}}+C_{\text{right}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle T</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜ℎ</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>𝑜𝑔</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(H+1)DW_{\mathit{oh}}+(H+2)DW_{\mathit{og}}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Derivation complete.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
</section>
